# Great Train Heist, second mode ({R} + {2}): "Creatures you control get +1/+0 and gain first strike until end of turn" (CR 611.2c). Memnite attacks and Bot2 blocks with Bile-Vial Boggart;
# Heist in the declare blockers step makes Memnite 2/1 with first strike, so it kills the Boggart before it deals damage. The effect only reaches creatures Bot1 controlled when it resolved:
# an Ornithopter cast afterwards is 0/2 with Flying only. Bot2's Boggart did not get it (it died without dealing damage).
